                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8BA6C1', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>关注了哪类患者？他们面临什么真实困难？为什么值得解决？</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3B5675' }}>P03</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 86, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18, padding: '0 22px', background: 'linear-gradient(150deg, #14294A 0%, #0E2039 100%)', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(139,166,193,0.22)' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 700, color: '#22D3EE', width: 44 }}>02</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 700, color: '#E8F1FA', width: 250 }}>产品与解决方案</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8BA6C1', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>产品是什么？有哪些核心功能？如何使用？成本与可支付性是多少？</Text>
